{"pr": 31130, "type": "features", "branch": "8.1.x", "title": "Unify stabilize and enable product feature flag", "url": "https://github.com/PrestaShop/PrestaShop/pull/31130", "issue": 31086, "issue_title": "Turn product page v2 into stable page", "issue_body": "### Prerequisites\r\n\r\n- [X] I understand and accept the project's [code of conduct](https://github.com/PrestaShop/PrestaShop/blob/develop/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md).\r\n- [X] I have already [searched in existing issues](https://github.com/PrestaShop/PrestaShop/issues?q=is%3Aissue+label%3ABug) and found no previous report of this bug.\r\n\r\n### Describe the bug and add attachments\r\n\r\nNow that the product page is considered stable even in multishop mode we need to change a fe things:\r\n- remove the Experimental block on the page in multi shop mode\r\n- merge the two feature flags into one `product_page_v2_multi_shop` will be merged into `product_page_v2` (the label should now be `New product page`\r\n- related code to the `product_page_v2_multi_shop` feature flag should be cleaned especially this part https://github.com/PrestaShop/PrestaShop/blob/c067bcf6199f41deaa87d31d4bcbe2194890c73b/src/Adapter/Preferences/PreferencesConfiguration.php#L120\r\n- the feature flag stability of `product_page_v2` should be switch to `stable`\r\n- the default value of product v2 is enabled\r\n\r\n### Expected behavior\r\n\r\nOne feature flag to activate the product page v2\r\n\r\n### Steps to reproduce\r\n\r\nExpected behaviour to test\r\n1. Go to New & Experimental Features\r\n2. There should only one feature flag related to the product page\r\n3. The product page feature flag should be in the stable block\r\n4. When accessing to the product page V2 in multi shop mode I don't see an experimental warning anymore\r\n5. When product page V2 is enabled and I enable the multishop feature, the product page V2 remains enabled\r\n\r\n\r\n### PrestaShop version(s) where the bug happened\r\n\r\n8.1\r\n\r\n### PHP version(s) where the bug happened\r\n\r\n_No response_\r\n\r\n### If your bug is related to a module, specify its name and its version\r\n\r\n_No response_", "base_commit": "8246aac05f0818d7d27b6b4035ab0e8857e5ce26", "merge_commit": "6ac31a88da2b38927880641a7e88b24f995ba442", "files": ["classes/QuickAccess.php", "classes/lang/KeysReference/FeatureFlagLang.php", "controllers/admin/AdminImagesController.php", "install-dev/data/xml/feature_flag.xml", "src/Adapter/Preferences/PreferencesConfiguration.php", "src/Core/FeatureFlag/FeatureFlagSettings.php", "src/PrestaShopBundle/Controller/Admin/ProductController.php", "src/PrestaShopBundle/Controller/Admin/Sell/Catalog/Product/ProductController.php", "src/PrestaShopBundle/Entity/Repository/FeatureFlagRepository.php", "src/PrestaShopBundle/Resources/config/services/adapter/data_configuration.yml", "src/PrestaShopBundle/Resources/config/services/bundle/repository.yml", "src/PrestaShopBundle/Resources/config/services/bundle/routing.yml", "src/PrestaShopBundle/Resources/views/Admin/Sell/Catalog/Product/edit.html.twig", "tests/Integration/Classes/controller/AdminControllerTest.php", "tests/Integration/PrestaShopBundle/Controller/Admin/FrameworkBundleAdminControllerTest.php", "tests/Integration/PrestaShopBundle/Controller/Sell/Catalog/CombinationControllerTest.php", "tests/Integration/PrestaShopBundle/Controller/Sell/Catalog/MultiShopProductControllerTest.php", "tests/Integration/PrestaShopBundle/Controller/Sell/Catalog/ProductControllerTest.php", "tests/UI/README.md", "tests/UI/campaigns/functional/BO/02_orders/01_orders/createOrders/06_addProductToTheCart.ts", "tests/UI/campaigns/functional/BO/02_orders/01_orders/viewAndEditOrder/02_productBlock.ts", "tests/UI/campaigns/functional/BO/02_orders/01_orders/viewAndEditOrder/11_checkInvoice.ts", "tests/UI/campaigns/functional/BO/02_orders/01_orders/viewAndEditOrder/12_checkMultiInvoice.ts", "tests/UI/campaigns/functional/BO/02_orders/02_invoices/03_invoiceOptions/02_enableDisableTaxBreakdown.ts", "tests/